  "title": "Rally Prague Revival Štefan Šraga – Photo & Video I Marketing I Gaming I Esport",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "SINCE 2015",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">SINCE 2015</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "This weekend, I headed to Rallye Prague Revival with my colleague Matěj, who’s also a photographer, and I was really excited to see what the event had in store for us. Amazing atmosphere, classic cars with real character, the smell of fuel, dust, puddles, mud… everything you’d expect and more. The whole event had such an incredible vibe and offered plenty of moments worth capturing. A perfect way to wrap up the weekend – full of adrenaline, photos, and inspiration.",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\">This weekend, I headed to <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Rallye Prague Revival</span></span> with my colleague Matěj, who’s also a photographer, and I was really excited to see what the event had in store for us. <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Amazing atmosphere</span></span>, classic cars with <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">real character</span></span>, the smell of fuel, dust, puddles, mud… everything you’d expect and more. The whole event had such an <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">incredible vibe</span></span> and offered plenty of moments worth capturing. A perfect way to wrap up the weekend – full of adrenaline, photos, and <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">inspiration</span></span>.</h2>"
    },
